flowchart TD
  event{CI event}
  event -->|Push to next or main| full[Every job and every test]
  event -->|Pull request| draft{Draft?}
  draft -->|Yes| light[Selected Linux tests and static checks]
  light --> blocked[Fan-ins fail: skipped draft]
  draft -->|No| select{Full label or uncertain input?}
  select -->|Yes| all[All unit tests]
  select -->|No| imports[Imports plus always-run tests]
  all --> pools[Selected platform pools]
  imports --> pools
  pools --> gate[Required test fan-in]
  select --> native[Native jobs follow input scope]
  select --> docker[Docker follows existing scope]
  full --> release[Exact-head full push gate]
  class light,pools,full live
  class blocked fail
  class gate,release ok
